{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51831","headline":"题莲花洞 · 独孤均","name":"题莲花洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路回千曲绕芝田，羽客相擕访谪仙。\n石窦嵌空惟有迹，灵龛隐轸莫知年。\n来居洞里长无死，不出人间自有天。\n更欲不眠吟至晓，恐惊龙动起愁烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}